# Curated service catalogue: the high-abstraction skeleton of the service shell.
# Each line is one service. The long tail comes from CrUX and is attached beneath this catalogue.
# Columns:
#   domain   - registrable domain, or a hostname for products on a subdomain
#   label
#   category - slug from taxonomy.json
#   org      - slug; orgs not in orgs.psv are created automatically
#   aliases  - comma-separated extra domains folded into this service
#   icon     - simple-icons slug
#   hosted   - comma-separated ASNs serving it; default = the org's ASNs, else DNS
# domain | label | category | org | aliases | icon | hosted
